### 7.7 handle inexistente /zeta: 1ª=404 MISS | 2ª=404 HIT | /zeta/doc=404 MISS
  criado no "banco", SEM revalidar: /zeta=404 (HIT)
  revalidatePath("/zeta","layout"): /zeta=404 (HIT)
  revalidatePath("/zeta")  [literal]: /zeta=200 MISS -> 200 HIT | /zeta/doc ainda 404 HIT
  revalidatePath("/zeta/doc")  [literal]: /zeta/doc=200 HIT

